# Three substantive Mathlib gaps — partial fillings

This file attempts the three substantive remaining tasks from
[`mass-tower-deeper-fillers.md`](mass-tower-deeper-fillers.md):

(1) **`BlochGroup F` quotient.** Free abelian group on
    `(F \ {0,1}) × (F \ {0,1})` modulo the 5-term pentagon
    relation, plus the antisymmetry `[x] + [1/x] = 0`.
(2) **Pentagon identity for `Cl_2`.** The 5-term identity in
